{
  "file": "uac-0050-group-using-new-phishing.json",
  "text": "The Computer Emergency Response Team of Ukraine (CERT-UA) warns about new phishing attacks attributed to the threat group UAC-0050. The attackers use phishing emails with malicious attachments, typically archives containing shortcut (LNK) files. Opening these files leads to the execution of a series of payloads, ultimately delivering Remcos RAT or Meduza Stealer. The activity is focused on government agencies and other organizations in Ukraine. CERT-UA has identified that UAC-0050 has been active for several years and continuously updates its tactics to evade detection.",
